<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN BY 4 WICKETS IN SHARJAH FINAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN BY 4 WICKETS IN SHARJAH FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Pakistan by four wickets in the final of the Sharjah Cup cricket tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 214 all out in 49.2 overs, Sri Lanka 215-6 in 49.2 overs.</p>
</text>
